# netsurf: polyfill -- listener objects, once and signal everywhere; template content; fragment queries; 73 missing DOM APIs
#
# - addEventListener dropped listener OBJECTS ({handleEvent}); every
#   bridge addEventListener is wrapped: objects become stable functions,
#   once / signal are honoured uniformly.
# - <template>.content (a fragment holding the children) and
#   DocumentFragment querySelector/All, getElementById, children, append.
# - A census of ~250 common APIs found 89 missing; now 16. Among them:
#   parentElement (!), innerText, localName, namespaceURI, reflected
#   hidden/lang/dir/tabIndex, the *NS attribute methods, element
#   scrollTo/scrollBy, the form-control API (defaultValue, form, labels,
#   selection range, validity / checkValidity / setCustomValidity,
#   form.requestSubmit / submit / elements), Text length / splitText,
#   document.importNode / elementFromPoint / styleSheets / characterSet /
#   compatMode, WheelEvent / TouchEvent / ErrorEvent, File, FileReader,
#   Option, Audio, DOMMatrix, WebSocket / EventSource / Worker stubs that
#   fail like a refused connection, and a customElements registry that
#   upgrades existing and inserted elements (prototype + connectedCallback).
